    {"id":"p3-002","type":"multiple-choice","prompt":"Which means ‘What about the bookstore?’","choices":["서점은요?","서점이 아니에요?","서점도 없어요?"],"answers":["서점은요?"],"displayAnswer":"서점은요?","explanation":"The Lesson 3 PPT introduces 은요?/는요? as a compact topic-shift question.","conceptIds":["g3-topic-shift"],"difficulty":1},
    {"id":"p3-003","type":"typing","prompt":"Say ‘I have a question.’","answers":["질문이 있어요.","질문이 있어요"],"displayAnswer":"질문이 있어요.","explanation":"Possession is N이/가 있어요/없어요.","conceptIds":["g3-possession"],"difficulty":1},
    {"id":"p3-004","type":"multiple-choice","prompt":"Choose the respectful existence form for ‘The teacher is at home.’","choices":["선생님이 집에 있어요.","선생님이 집에 계세요.","선생님이 집에 있으세요."],"answers":["선생님이 집에 계세요."],"displayAnswer":"선생님이 집에 계세요.","explanation":"The PPT distinguishes 계세요 for honorific existence from 있으세요 for honorific possession.","conceptIds":["g3-honorific-exist"],"difficulty":2},
