    {"id":"p3-006","type":"multiple-choice","prompt":"Choose the connector that means ‘so/therefore.’","choices":["그리고","그런데","그래서"],"answers":["그래서"],"displayAnswer":"그래서","explanation":"The PPT groups 그래서 with sentence connectors and gives it the result meaning ‘so.’","conceptIds":["g3-connectors"],"difficulty":1},
